  "description": "<p>The LDP specification recommends using a trailing slash in the URIs of containers:<br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/ldp-bp/#include-a-trailing-slash-in-container-uris\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/TR/ldp-bp/#include-a-trailing-slash-in-container-uris</a></p>\n\n<p>This task is to:<br/>\n1) confirm with the F4 committer team that this is a recommendation that we want to enforce<br/>\n2) investigate the impact of enforcing this recommendation<br/>\n3) implement it</p>",
